# Machine-local agent scaffolding and run receipts, not deliverables. `.l9/`
# tracks contracts, but `.l9/pr/` and `.l9/autonomy/` are per-run output from
# the publish ladder, and `.claude/` is session bootstrap. All three embed
# absolute paths for the host that produced them, so they are never portable.
.claude/
.l9/pr/
.l9/autonomy/
